{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014Th66p5KSxp8FJ78qDAY2T","type":"tool_result","content":"-rw-r--r--  1 kavi  wheel  184  5月 24 06:01 /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-kavi-Documents-Claude-Projects-AI-----/8ec2be0e-7044-4cf5-b320-08a8fd867617/tasks/bk058ed0i.output\nkavi             27080  10.5  0.9 418701712  78528   ??  S     6:00上午   0:13.50 /Library/Frameworks/Python.framework/Versions/3.11/Resources/Python.app/Contents/MacOS/Python scripts/build_event_index.py\nkavi             27030   2.6  3.3 515302928 275456 s003  S+    6:00上午   0:07.22 /Users/kavi/.local/bin/claude -p 非互動模式：對決策日曆做統計檢討，一個 turn 跑完不要中途停下。流程：\\0120. **必須先 rebuild event_index**：`python3 scripts/build_event_index.py` — 此 indexer 掃 reports/ + investment/invest_logs/ + news/news_logs/ + sector/sector_logs/ 重建 `reports/decision_review/event_index_latest.json`（含每筆 decision 的 verdict、新增 `industry_rollup` + `adjustment_ledger_active` 兩個 top-level 欄位）。**rc 必須 0** 才繼續；rc≠0 就 fail 整個 protocol、不要硬跑舊 index。預期 ~30-60 秒。\\0121. **Read** `reports/decision_review/REVIEW_PROMPT.md` 拿到完整 prompt 規範（**四步驟**：Step 0 Adjustment Evaluation + Step 1 Pattern + Step 2 Root Cause + Step 3 Recommendations）\\0122. **Read** 剛 rebuild 的 `reports/decision_review/event_index_latest.json`（過去決策 + verdict 集合 + industry_rollup + adjustment_ledger_active，可能 300KB+）。確認 `generated_at` 是今天日期，否則 abort\\0123. 依 REVIEW_PROMPT 四步驟執行：\\012   - **Step 0 — Adjustment Evaluation（先做）**：對 `adjustment_ledger_active` 中每筆 active Rec，從 industry_rollup / decisions / 外部資料拉出 `target_metric` 當週數值，對照 ledger 的 `evaluation_history` 上次值，下 improved / no_change / regressed 判斷。連 3 週 no_change 建議 paused；regressed 建議 rolled-back。完整 ledger 在 `reports/decision_review/ADJUSTMENT_LEDGER.md`，schema 在 `ADJUSTMENT_LEDGER_SCHEMA.md`\\012   - Step 1 — Pattern Detection：依 source / verdict / window_complete_pct / decisive_agent / regime / sub_industry_heat 統計顯著 pattern (N≥5 才算 pattern；N=3-4 標 preliminary；N≤2 標 speculation)。**必看 `industry_rollup`** 找 sub-industry / sector 集中性\\012   - Step 2 — Root Cause Hypotheses：對每個 pattern 提出 1-2 個假設，引用 specific decision_id 為證據\\012   - Step 3 — Adjustment Recommendations：給 protocol/config 具體調整建議（agent 權重、score 閾值、cycle phase 規則等），標 confidence (high/med/low) + 影響範圍\\0124. **Write** 結果到 `reports/decision_review/REVIEW_<TODAY>.md`（YYYY-MM-DD 為今天日期）。Markdown 結構：\\012```markdown\\012# LLM Review · YYYY-MM-DD\\012\\012_event_index_at: <event_index 的 generated_at>_  \\012_decisions_analyzed: <N>_\\012\\012## 0. Adjustment Evaluation\\012| Rec | applied_date | target_metric | last_value | this_week_value | judgement |\\012|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\012\\012## Pattern Detection\\012### <Pattern Title> (n=N, N≥5 robust / N=3-4 preliminary / N≤2 speculation)\\012- 證據：<引用 specific decisions>\\012- 統計：<numbers>\\012\\012## Industry Rollup\\012| industry | sector | n | miss_rate | avg_miss_return | tickers | top_30%? |\\012|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\012\\012## Root Cause Hypotheses\\012### <Hypothesis>\\012- 對應 pattern：<which>\\012- 推論：<reasoning>\\012\\012## Adjustment Recommendations\\012### <Recommendation Title>\\012- 動作：<concrete config change>\\012- Confidence：high|med|low\\012- 影響：<scope>\\012```\\0125. **禁止**：跳過 Step 0 indexer rebuild、跳過 Adjustment Evaluation、跑到一半停下問問題、輸出意見徵詢、未產出 MD 就結束。\\012\\012決策日曆 LLM Review --output-format stream-json --verbose --permission-mode bypassPermissions\nkavi             27078   0.0  0.0 442205456   1248   ??  Ss    6:00上午   0:00.00 /bin/zsh -c source /Users/kavi/.claude/shell-snapshots/snapshot-zsh-1779573610249-6deg0q.sh 2>/dev/null || true && setopt NO_EXTENDED_GLOB NO_BARE_GLOB_QUAL 2>/dev/null || true && eval 'python3 scripts/build_event_index.py' < /dev/null && pwd -P >| /tmp/claude-200a-cwd","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8ec2be0e-7044-4cf5-b320-08a8fd867617","uuid":"c83e4164-7416-4dd3-8940-5c609bf55703","timestamp":"2026-05-23T22:02:39.427Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"-rw-r--r--  1 kavi  whe